This Program is an AREXX script for
TransAmiga BBS which automaticaly
scans new uploaded files for
viruses including archived files!
This new version also scans for
FILE_ID.DIZ text files and adds
them to the long desciption
of the file, on the BBS
Needs Virus Checker V6.44 or
greater.

